COMPILATION ERROR BLOCKING ALL WORK: packages/brep-rs/src/ops.rs:524 tries to access face.plane but Face struct has surface field. Fix needed:

CURRENT (lines 523-524):
                    let face = f.borrow();
                    let face_plane = &face.plane;

SHOULD BE:
                    let face = f.borrow();
                    let face_plane = match &face.surface {
                        Surface::Plane(p) => p,
                        _ => continue, // Not a planar face, skip
                    };

This is a bug fix, not a feature change. Need this fixed to run any tests. Please apply or release claim so I can fix it.
